      "path": "/books/al-kafi:2:2:16:4",
      "text": [
        " إِلَّا أَنَّهُ قَالَ ثُمَّ الثَّنَاءُ ثُمَّ الِاعْتِرَافُ بِالذَّنْبِ ."
      ],
      "translations": {
        "en.hubeali": [
          "And from him, from Ibn Fazzal, from Sa’alba, from Muawiya Bin Ammar, ",
          "(It has been narrated) from Abu Abdullah<sup>asws</sup>, similar to it except that he<sup>asws</sup> said: ‘Then the laudation, then the acknowledgement of the sin’."
        ],
        "en.sarwar": [
          "4. It is narrated from him (narrator of the Hadith above) from ibn Faddal from Tha’labah from Mu’awiyah ibn ‘Ammar the following: “Mu’awiyah ibn ‘Ammar has narrated from abu ‘Abd Allah (a.s.) a similar Hadith except that he said, ‘Then praising and confessing sins.’” "
        ]
      }
